iPortal incorporates the original iPhone Mirror codebase by Max Hager
(yachty66), imported from https://github.com/yachty66/iphone-mirror at
commit 877aa4f. The upstream package declares the MIT license.

Subsequent iPortal development is maintained by bare-metal-gpu.
An imported baseline in this repository records the import, not authorship
of the upstream code. Upstream attribution is retained here independently
of GitHub's contributor graph.

WebDriverAgent, ThinkingOrbsKit, BorderBeamKit, Inter, and other dependencies
retain their respective licenses and notices.

The optional native media backend uses idevice (MIT), copyright 2026 Jackson
Coxson, pinned by native/Cargo.lock. Its license is in native/LICENSE-idevice.txt.
Apple CoreDevice framework binaries are provided by Xcode and are not redistributed.
